  <title type="title-main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Functionality and interface specifications for GSTN transport network equipment for interconnecting GSTN and IP networks</title>
  <title type="main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Functionality and interface specifications for GSTN transport network equipment for interconnecting GSTN and IP networks</title>
